WEBVTT

1
00:00:02,190 --> 00:00:12,740
Are we two left behind?

2
00:00:17,600 --> 00:00:18,640
Just out of the water, don't move

3
00:00:20,470 --> 00:00:23,970
Uncle Chen. It is Uncle Chen who is on the mission.

4
00:00:24,170 --> 00:00:25,570
You take out this thing every time

5
00:00:25,570 --> 00:00:26,570
What on earth is it?

6
00:00:26,570 --> 00:00:27,770
A small piece of equipment from Guoan

7
00:00:27,770 --> 00:00:30,410
It can block almost all current monitoring. You don’t know what is happening abroad.

8
00:00:30,410 --> 00:00:31,370
How are they all rolled up?

9
00:00:31,770 --> 00:00:33,370
They use laser side glass vibrations

10
00:00:33,490 --> 00:00:35,610
Then use the algorithm to solve the problem in reverse and find out what the people in the room said.

11
00:00:35,610 --> 00:00:36,850
Never seen this method before

12
00:00:36,970 --> 00:00:38,170
We also suffered a lot of losses

13
00:00:38,170 --> 00:00:40,010
Uncle Chen, the mission reward is out

14
00:00:40,910 --> 00:00:44,710
Isn't it another technical document? It's not a technical document, but I think

15
00:00:44,710 --> 00:00:45,990
The value is no less than technical information

16
00:00:46,510 --> 00:00:47,790
OK how to say
